    a: 'Konto zakłada się w 30 sekund i od razu można pracować na gotowych agentach. Narzędzia podpina osoba, która ma do nich dostęp, zwykłym logowaniem. Dobre odpowiedzi na trudne pytania przychodzą po zebraniu kontekstu firmy: dokumentów, procedur i ustaleń. To kilka dni pracy, a przy wdrożeniu z opiekunem robimy ją razem z Wami.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Czy appto wyśle coś do klienta bez naszej wiedzy?',
    a: 'Nie, jeśli tak tego nie ustawicie. Dla każdego agenta wyznaczacie granicę: co robi sam, a co zatrzymuje się jako szkic do akceptacji. Domyślnie wszystko, co wychodzi na zewnątrz, na przykład mail do klienta albo zmiana kwoty na dealu, czeka na kliknięcie człowieka.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Gdzie są nasze dane?',
    a: 'Na serwerach w Unii Europejskiej, w Irlandii. Modele nie uczą się na Waszych treściach. Agent widzi dokładnie tyle, co osoba, która zleca mu zadanie, a dane osobowe z wgrywanych plików można zamaskować, zanim trafią do modelu. Umowę powierzenia podpisujemy przed startem.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Ile to kosztuje?',
    a: 'Płacicie za zużycie, w modelu pay-as-you-go albo z pakietu kredytów. W administracji ustawia się limity na osobę i na zespół, więc koszt da się przypiąć do działu. Aktualne stawki są w cenniku na appto.ai. Wdrożenie z opiekunem wyceniamy osobno, po rozmowie.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Kto stoi za appto?',
    a: "Appto budujemy w Let's automate, w grupie Wise Group. Pracujemy na nim codziennie u siebie i wdrażamy je u klientów. Funkcja trafia do produktu wtedy, gdy któreś z wdrożeń pokazało, że jest potrzebna.",
  },
];

const faqLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: FAQ.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a } })),
};
---
<LaBase
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ogImage="/og/hub.png"
  ctaHref="#kontakt"
  ctaLabel="Umów pokaz"
  noindex
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style is:global>
  /* =====================================================================
     TOKENY appto.ai (src/styles/landing/styles.css + feature-page.css)
     Wszystko pod .ap, żeby nie ruszać reszty serwisu.
     ===================================================================== */
  .ap{
    --ink:#0A0A0B;--ink-2:#26262B;--muted:#63636D;--muted-2:#9A9AA4;
    --line:rgba(10,10,11,.09);--line-2:rgba(10,10,11,.16);
    --tint:#F5F5F8;--amber:#F0CE68;--amber-2:#E9C24E;--ok:#1F9D55;
    --font:'Geist','Schibsted Grotesk',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    --display:'Schibsted Grotesk','Geist',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
    --ease-out:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
    --gutter:clamp(20px,5vw,56px);
    --sec:clamp(76px,7.4vw,128px);
    background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;
    letter-spacing:-.012em;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;overflow-x:clip;
  }
  .ap :where(h1,h2,h3,p,ol,ul,figure,figcaption){margin:0;padding:0}
  .ap :where(ol,ul){list-style:none}
  .ap :where(img,svg){display:block;max-width:100%}
  .ap :where(button){font:inherit;color:inherit;background:none;border:0;padding:0;cursor:pointer;-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none}
  .ap :where(kbd){font-family:inherit}
  .ap-wrap{width:100%;max-width:calc(1440px + 2 * var(--gutter));margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:var(--gutter);position:relative}

  /* ---------- przyciski appto ---------- */
  .ap-btn{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:14px;font-family:var(--font);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.014em;border:1px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1),background .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,color .2s ease}
  .ap-btn svg{width:17px;height:17px}
  .ap-btn .ap-arr{transition:transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
  .ap-btn:hover .ap-arr{transform:translateX(3px)}
  .ap-btn--lg{height:52px;padding:0 28px;font-size:16px}
  .ap-btn--pri{color:#fff;background:#141417;border-color:#141417;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(10,10,11,.14)}
  .ap-btn--pri:hover{background:#000}
  .ap-btn--sec{color:#26262B;background:#F1F1F3}
  .ap-btn--sec:hover{background:#E7E7EA}
  .ap-acts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px}

  /* ================================================================ HERO
     1:1 z hero strony głównej appto: wyśrodkowany nagłówek 68 px, szare lede,
     para przycisków, cichy podpis. Nad nagłówkiem logo produktu — na stronie
     Let's automate trzeba najpierw powiedzieć, o czym jest strona. */
  .ap-hero-c{text-align:center;padding-block:clamp(40px,6.5vw,92px) clamp(30px,4.5vw,56px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .ap-logo{height:clamp(26px,2.3vw,32px);width:auto;margin-bottom:clamp(24px,2.8vw,36px)}
  .ap-h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(36px,5.4vw,68px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:var(--ink);max-width:20ch;text-wrap:balance}
  .ap-sub{margin-top:20px;font-size:clamp(16px,1.45vw,19px);line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);max-width:54ch;text-wrap:balance}
  .ap-hero-c .ap-acts{margin-top:28px;justify-content:center}
  .ap-micro{margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted-2);letter-spacing:0}

  /* gradientowy panel ze screenem produktu (.stage-panel) */
  .ap-stage-p{width:calc(100% - 2 * clamp(16px,5vw,76px));max-width:1640px;margin-inline:auto;border-radius:40px;overflow:hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(48% 55% at 12% 12%, #E5E3F1 0%, rgba(229,227,241,0) 62%),
      radial-gradient(50% 55% at 90% 8%,  #DBE6F2 0%, rgba(219,230,242,0) 64%),
      radial-gradient(55% 60% at 86% 96%, #EFE9E4 0%, rgba(239,233,228,0) 60%),
      linear-gradient(165deg, #F0EFF5 0%, #EBEEF4 52%, #F4F1ED 100%)}
  .ap-stage-in{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:clamp(26px,4.5vw,68px) clamp(20px,4vw,68px) 0}

  /* ---------- OKNO INBOX AI (.mk-*, przepisane ze strony głównej appto) ---------- */
  .mk{--mk-ink:#14130F;--mk-mut:#8A8681;--mk-mut2:#B4B0A9;--mk-line:rgba(20,19,15,.09);--mk-bg:#FAF9F7;--mk-h:clamp(470px,40vw,528px);
    width:100%;max-width:1240px;margin-inline:auto;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;overflow:hidden;background:var(--mk-bg);
    border:1px solid rgba(10,10,11,.08);border-bottom:0;max-height:var(--mk-h);filter:drop-shadow(0 20px 50px rgba(20,20,23,.25));
    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#000 92%,transparent 100%);mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#000 92%,transparent 100%);
    font-size:14px;color:var(--mk-ink);text-align:left}
  .mk-app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.12fr) minmax(0,.88fr);background:var(--mk-bg);height:calc(var(--mk-h) - 52px)}
  .mk-main{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
  .mk-top{height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 16px}
  .mk-top-l{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
  .mk-logo{height:16px;width:auto}
  .mk-sep{color:rgba(20,19,15,.2);font-size:15px}
  .mk-crumb{font-size:13px;font-weight:450;color:var(--mk-mut);letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .mk-center{flex:1 1 auto;width:100%;max-width:720px;margin-inline:auto;padding:16px 24px 28px}
  .mk-hello-h{font-family:var(--font);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--mk-ink);margin:4px 0 14px}
  .mk-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.11);border-radius:20px;padding:18px 20px 13px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,19,15,.04)}
  .mk-input{min-height:62px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-caret{display:inline-block;width:1.5px;height:17px;background:var(--mk-ink);margin-left:1px;transform:translateY(3px);animation:mk-blink 1.1s step-end infinite}
  @keyframes mk-blink{50%{opacity:0}}
  .mk-card-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:6px}
  .mk-model{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:27px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.10);background:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--mk-ink)}
  .mk-model svg{width:14px;height:14px}
  .mk-model .chev{width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-card-actions{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .mk-cic{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--mk-mut);border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.10)}
  .mk-cic svg{width:14px;height:14px}
  .mk-send{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;background:#A1A1A1}
  .mk-send svg{width:14px;height:14px}
  .mk-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:13px -20px -13px;padding:6px 16px;background:#F1F0EE;border-radius:0 0 19px 19px}
  .mk-tools-l{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mk-mut);font-weight:500}
  .mk-tools-l svg{width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-tools-r{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .mk-tool{min-width:24px;height:24px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.07);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,19,15,.06)}
  .mk-tool img{width:13px;height:13px;object-fit:contain}
  .mk-inbox{margin-top:26px}
  .mk-grp{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:15px 0 7px}
  .mk-inbox .mk-grp:first-child{margin-top:0}
  .mk-grp-h{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:550;color:var(--mk-ink);letter-spacing:-.012em}
  .mk-grp-h b{font-weight:400;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-left:3px}
  .mk-grp--old .mk-grp-h{color:var(--mk-mut)}
  .mk-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
  .mk-dot--ok{background:#44B982}
  .mk-dot--run{background:#F4C36E}
  .mk-filter{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-filter svg{width:13px;height:13px}
  .mk-rows{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
  .mk-rows + .mk-grp{margin-top:15px}
  .mk-row{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:9px 13px;background:#fff}
  .mk-row + .mk-row{border-top:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.06)}
  .mk-row.is-sel{background:#F2F2F2}
  .mk-row-go{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;color:var(--mk-mut2);opacity:.8}
  .mk-row-ic{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:9px;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#F4F4F4;color:#9C9C9C}
  .mk-row-ic svg{width:15px;height:15px}
  .mk-row-ic--ok{background:#ECF8F2;color:#35966A}
  .mk-row-ic--run{background:#FEF6E9;color:#E6B16E}
  .mk-row-ic--run svg{animation:mk-spin 1.4s linear infinite}
  @keyframes mk-spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
  .mk-row-t{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--mk-mut);letter-spacing:-.012em;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .mk-row-t.is-new{color:var(--mk-ink)}
  .mk-row-tx{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.3}
  .mk-row-tx b{font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--mk-ink);letter-spacing:-.012em;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .mk-row-tx i{font-size:11px;font-style:normal;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-top:1px}
  .mk-row-time{flex:none;font-size:11px;color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-thread{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;min-height:0;margin:4px 14px 0 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.07);border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(20,19,15,.04),0 22px 48px -30px rgba(20,19,15,.3)}
  .mk-th-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:13px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--mk-line)}
  .mk-th-tx{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.3}
  .mk-th-tx b{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mk-ink);letter-spacing:-.012em;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .mk-th-tx i{font-size:11.5px;font-style:normal;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-top:2px}
  .mk-th-acts{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:none}
  .mk-th-ic{display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--mk-mut)}
  .mk-th-ic svg{width:16px;height:16px}
  .mk-th-body{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  .mk-bub{align-self:flex-end;max-width:94%;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:20px;background:#272727;color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .mk-ans{margin-top:16px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--mk-ink);letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .ap .mk-list{margin:11px 0 0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;list-style:decimal}
  .mk-list li{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--mk-ink);letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .mk-list li::marker{color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-list b{font-weight:620}
  .mk-file{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;padding:7px 12px 7px 8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.11);border-radius:11px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,19,15,.04);max-width:100%}
  .mk-file-ic{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#FDECE8;color:#D2563A}
  .mk-file-ic svg{width:16px;height:16px}
  .mk-file-tx{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;line-height:1.3}
  .mk-file-tx b{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:550;color:var(--mk-ink);letter-spacing:-.012em;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .mk-file-tx i{font-size:11px;font-style:normal;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-top:1px}
  .mk-file-go{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-left:4px}
  .mk-time{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mk-mut2)}
  .mk-time svg{width:14px;height:14px}
  .mk-th-comp{flex:none;margin:8px 12px 12px;padding:11px 13px 8px;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.10);border-radius:18px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.7) inset,0 10px 26px -22px rgba(20,19,15,.5)}
  .mk-th-comp .mk-card-bar{justify-content:flex-end}
  .mk-th-inp{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-bottom:20px}
  .mk-ctx{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mk-mut2);margin-right:2px}
  .mk-ring{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;border:1.6px solid rgba(20,19,15,.16)}

  /* ======================================================= CZYM JEST APPTO
     .reveal-sec ze strony głównej: zdania rozjaśniają się wraz ze scrollem. */
  .ap-rev{background:#fff;padding-block:clamp(96px,13vw,180px)}
  .ap-rev-in{max-width:940px;margin-inline:auto}
  .ap-rev-eb{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:clamp(28px,4vw,44px)}
  .ap-rev-eb::before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber-2);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(240,206,104,.28)}
  .ap-rev-tx{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(26px,3.5vw,46px);line-height:1.34;letter-spacing:-.022em;color:var(--ink);text-wrap:pretty}
  .ap-rev-tx .s{opacity:.14;transition:opacity .2s linear}

  /* ============================================== SZKIELET SEKCJI (fp-*) */
  .fp-sec{position:relative;background:#fff;padding:var(--sec) 0}
  .fp-sec--tint{background:var(--tint)}
  .fp-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.14fr) minmax(0,.86fr);gap:18px clamp(40px,5vw,90px);align-items:end;margin:0 auto clamp(40px,4.4vw,68px)}
  .fp-head h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,52px);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.042em;color:var(--ink)}
  .fp-head h2 span{display:block}
  .fp-head p{font-size:clamp(15px,1.25vw,17.5px);line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);max-width:48ch}
  .fp-head p b{color:var(--ink-2);font-weight:600}

  /* CTA na szwie dwóch sekcji */
  .fp-seam-w{position:relative;height:0;z-index:5}
  .fp-seam{position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;translate:-50% -50%;width:min(calc(100% - 40px),1000px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 1px auto;align-items:center;gap:clamp(22px,3vw,48px);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:18px;padding:clamp(20px,2.2vw,26px) clamp(24px,2.8vw,36px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(10,10,11,.03),0 36px 66px -40px rgba(10,10,11,.4)}
  .fp-seam-r{display:block;align-self:stretch;width:1px;background:var(--line)}
  .fp-seam-t{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(18px,1.85vw,25px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.034em;color:var(--ink);text-wrap:balance}
  .fp-seam .ap-acts{flex-wrap:nowrap}
  .fp-sec--seam-b{padding-bottom:calc(var(--sec) + 66px)}
  .fp-sec--seam-t{padding-top:calc(var(--sec) + 66px)}

  /* =================================== FUNKCJE: ściana + dziewięć zdań (fh-*) */
  .fh{--grey:#8B8B95;--lbl:178px;--gut:clamp(24px,3vw,52px)}
  .fh-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.04fr);gap:clamp(28px,3.6vw,60px);align-items:center}
  .fh-h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,3.35vw,50px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:var(--ink);text-wrap:balance}
  .fh-lede{margin-top:clamp(18px,1.8vw,26px);max-width:42ch;font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}
  .fh-lede b{color:var(--ink-2);font-weight:600}
  .fh-credit{margin-top:clamp(20px,2vw,26px);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .fh-wall{position:relative;min-width:0;width:calc(100% + var(--gutter));height:clamp(430px,44vw,600px);overflow:hidden;
    -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 0,#000 10%,#000 90%,transparent 100%);mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 0,#000 10%,#000 90%,transparent 100%);
    opacity:0;transition:opacity .9s ease .1s;pointer-events:none}
  .fh-hero.is-in .fh-wall{opacity:1}
  .fh-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;align-items:start}
  .fh-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;will-change:transform}
  .fh-col-h{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding-bottom:12px}
  .fh-col--up{animation:fhUp var(--t) linear infinite}
  .fh-col--down{animation:fhDown var(--t) linear infinite}
  @keyframes fhUp{from{transform:translateY(0)}to{transform:translateY(-50%)}}
  @keyframes fhDown{from{transform:translateY(-50%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}
  .fh-t{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(10,10,11,.03),0 16px 26px -22px rgba(10,10,11,.38)}
  .fh-t img{width:18px;height:18px;object-fit:contain;flex:0 0 auto}
  .fh-t img.fh-lock{width:auto;height:15px;max-width:78px;margin-block:3px}
  .fh-t-x{min-width:0}
  .fh-t b{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.016em;line-height:1.25;color:var(--ink)}
  .fh-t i{display:block;font-style:normal;margin-top:3px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .fh-index-lead{max-width:1120px;margin:clamp(46px,5vw,76px) 0 clamp(-24px,-1.4vw,-14px);padding-left:calc(var(--lbl) + var(--gut));font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .fh-index{position:relative;max-width:1120px;margin-top:clamp(40px,4.4vw,68px)}
  .fh-index::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:4px;bottom:4px;left:calc(var(--lbl) + var(--gut) / 2);width:1px;background:var(--line-2);transform-origin:top center;transform:scaleY(0);transition:transform 1.5s cubic-bezier(.42,0,.12,1) .12s}
  .fh-index.is-in::before{transform:scaleY(1)}
  .fh-grp + .fh-grp{margin-top:clamp(30px,3.2vw,48px)}
  .fh-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:var(--lbl) minmax(0,1fr);gap:var(--gut);align-items:baseline;padding:clamp(9px,1vw,13px) 0;opacity:0;translate:0 14px;transition:opacity .6s var(--ease-out) calc(var(--i) * 150ms),translate .6s var(--ease-out) calc(var(--i) * 150ms)}
  .fh-index.is-in .fh-row{opacity:1;translate:0 0}
  .fh-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:6px;border-radius:6px}
  .fh-row-n{justify-self:end;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.014em;color:#7C7C87;white-space:nowrap;transition:color .24s ease}
  .fh-row-n svg{width:13px;height:13px;opacity:0;translate:-5px 0;transition:opacity .26s ease,translate .3s var(--ease-out)}
  .fh-row:hover .fh-row-n{color:var(--ink)}
  .fh-row:hover .fh-row-n svg{opacity:1;translate:0 0}
  .fh-row-s{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(19px,1.92vw,27px);line-height:1.36;letter-spacing:-.026em;color:var(--grey);text-wrap:pretty}
  .fh-row-s b{font-weight:inherit;color:var(--grey);background-image:linear-gradient(var(--amber),var(--amber));background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:0% .34em;background-position:0 88%;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;transition:color .55s ease calc(var(--i) * 150ms + 300ms),background-size .42s var(--ease-out)}
  .fh-index.is-in .fh-row-s b{color:var(--ink)}
  .fh-row:hover .fh-row-s b{background-size:100% .34em;transition-delay:0s}

  /* ============================== KONTEKST: okno w rozsypanych materiałach (k3-*) */
  .k3-stage{position:relative;height:clamp(430px,44vw,700px);container-type:inline-size}
  .k3-orbit{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1}
  .k3-obj{position:absolute;left:var(--x);top:var(--y);translate:-50% -50%;scale:var(--sc,1);opacity:0;animation:k3-float var(--dur,15s) ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:var(--del,0s)}
  .k3-stage.is-in .k3-obj{opacity:var(--o,1);transition:opacity .9s ease var(--in,0s)}
  @keyframes k3-float{0%,100%{translate:-50% -50%}50%{translate:-50% calc(-50% - 10px)}}
  .k3-doc{width:74px}
  .k3-doc-p{height:96px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.11);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,18,40,.05),0 14px 26px -14px rgba(20,18,40,.35);transform:rotate(var(--rot,0deg))}
  .k3-doc-bar{height:16px;background:var(--c,#E0555B)}
  .k3-doc-b{padding:9px 8px;display:grid;gap:5px;align-content:start}
  .k3-doc-b i{display:block;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(20,19,15,.13)}
  .k3-doc-b i:nth-child(3){width:62%}
  .k3-doc-b i:nth-child(5){width:44%}
  .k3-doc figcaption{margin-top:9px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--muted-2);text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.005em}
  .k3-brand{width:var(--w,38px);height:var(--w,38px);display:grid;place-items:center}
  .k3-brand img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}
  .k3-dev{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;translate:-50% -50%;z-index:3;width:min(760px,58cqw);opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)}
  .k3-stage.is-in .k3-dev{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity .8s ease,transform 1s var(--ease-out)}
  .k3-win{position:relative;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(10,10,11,.08);box-shadow:0 20px 50px -20px rgba(20,20,23,.25),0 60px 110px -50px rgba(20,20,23,.3);aspect-ratio:760 / 486}
  .k3-screen{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:760px;height:486px;transform-origin:0 0;transform:scale(var(--s,1));display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff}
  .k3-wtop{height:46px;flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:0 16px}
  .k3-wtop img{height:16px;width:auto}
  .k3-wsep{color:rgba(20,19,15,.2);font-size:15px}
  .k3-wcrumb{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#14130F;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .k3-wtop-r{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .k3-wtop-r kbd{font-size:11px;color:#8A8681;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.1);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px;background:#fff}
  .k3-ava{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#FFB07A,#F2896B)}
  .k3-main{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;padding:22px 24px 20px}
  .k3-user{align-self:flex-end;max-width:82%;width:fit-content;background:#14131A;color:#fff;padding:11px 15px;border-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:6px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:22px}
  .k3-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px}
  .k3-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:13.5px;color:#3A3833}
  .k3-step .ic{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto}
  .k3-step .ic img{width:18px;height:18px;object-fit:contain}
  .k3-step .tx{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0}
  .k3-step .tx b{font-weight:600;color:#14130F}
  .k3-step .tx span{color:#9A968F}
  .k3-step .ok{color:#12A05C;flex:0 0 auto}
  .k3-step .ok svg{width:18px;height:18px}
  .k3-answer{margin-top:15px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#57534B}
  .k3-answer p{color:#3A3833}
  .k3-answer b{font-weight:600;color:#14130F}
  .k3-answer ul{margin-top:11px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
  .k3-answer li{position:relative;padding-left:17px}
  .k3-answer li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:3px;top:8px;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber-2)}
  .k3-mark{box-shadow:inset 0 -.5em 0 rgba(240,206,104,.6);font-weight:600;color:#14130F}
  .k3-composer{flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 15px;background:#F5F4F1;border:1px solid rgba(20,19,15,.07);border-radius:14px}
  .k3-composer .ph{flex:1 1 auto;font-size:14px;color:#B4B0A9}
  .k3-composer .cb{color:#B4B0A9;display:grid;place-items:center}
  .k3-composer .cb svg{width:18px;height:18px}
  .k3-composer .csend{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9px;background:#14131A;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;flex:0 0 auto}
  .k3-composer .csend svg{width:15px;height:15px}
  @container (max-width:900px){ .k3-dev{width:76cqw} }

  /* ============================== AGENCI: zlecenie → w tle → wynik (ag-*) */
  .ag-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.92fr) minmax(0,1.06fr) minmax(0,1.12fr);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 26px 56px -36px rgba(20,20,23,.4)}
  .ag-fl{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:clamp(20px,2.2vw,30px);border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
  .ag-fl:first-child{border-left:0}
  .ag-fl-b{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:14px}
  .ag-fl--run{background:#FAFAFB}
  .ag-fl-l{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .ag-fl-l i{font-style:normal;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .ag-fl-l i.is-done{color:var(--ok)}
  .ag-fl-msg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:30px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:start}
  .ag-fl-av{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#EDEDF1;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-fl-msg p{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:14px 14px 14px 4px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:clamp(14px,1.2vw,15.5px);line-height:1.45}
  .ag-fl-note{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .ag-fl-log{height:168px;overflow:hidden;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 0,#000 16%,#000 100%);mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 0,#000 16%,#000 100%)}
  .ag-fl-track{transition:transform .5s var(--ease-out)}
  .ag-fl-r{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px minmax(0,1fr) 16px;gap:10px;align-items:center;height:42px;opacity:.32;transition:opacity .4s ease}
  .ag-fl-r.is-done,.ag-fl-r.is-now{opacity:1}
  .ag-fl-ic{display:grid;place-items:center;width:20px;height:20px}
  .ag-fl-ic img{width:18px;height:18px;object-fit:contain}
  .ag-fl-ic i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(10,10,11,.22)}
  .ag-fl-tx{font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--ink-2)}
  .ag-fl-r.is-done .ag-fl-tx{color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-fl-ck{width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--ok);opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s ease}
  .ag-fl-ck svg{width:100%;height:100%}
  .ag-fl-r.is-done .ag-fl-ck{opacity:1}
  .ag-fl-bar{height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(10,10,11,.09);overflow:hidden}
  .ag-fl-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--ink);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left}
  .ag-fl-meta{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .ag-fl-meta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
  .ag-res{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
  .ag-res-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .ag-res-h img{width:17px;height:17px}
  .ag-res-h b{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink)}
  .ag-res-ok{margin-left:auto;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(31,157,85,.1);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ok)}
  .ag-res-tb{padding:6px 14px 12px}
  .ag-res-tr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 62px 58px;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,11,.05)}
  .ag-res-tr span:nth-child(2),.ag-res-tr span:last-child{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-res-tr--h{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
  .ag-res-tr--h span{color:var(--muted-2) !important}
  .ag-res-tr.is-hot{background:rgba(240,206,104,.18);border-radius:6px;padding-inline:6px;margin-inline:-6px;border-bottom-color:transparent}
  .ag-res-more{display:block;padding-top:9px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .ag-res-p{padding:0 14px 14px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-res-p b{color:var(--ink-2);font-weight:600}

  /* ten sam agent w trzech miejscach */
  .ag-mark{display:block;width:52%;color:#fff}
  .ag-mark svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
  .ag-surf-g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,1.8vw,26px);padding-top:8px}
  .ag-sf{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(10,10,11,.08);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 46px -32px rgba(20,20,23,.5);transition:transform .4s var(--ease-out),box-shadow .4s ease}
  .ag-sf:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(-1.5deg) translateY(8px)}
  .ag-sf:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(-6px);z-index:2}
  .ag-sf:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(1.5deg) translateY(8px)}
  .ag-sf:hover{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(0deg);box-shadow:0 34px 60px -34px rgba(20,20,23,.55)}
  .ag-sf-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#fff}
  .ag-sf-bar img{width:15px;height:15px;object-fit:contain}
  .ag-sf-bar i{margin-left:auto;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;font-size:11.5px;opacity:.66}
  .ag-sf--appto .ag-sf-bar{background:#14131A}
  .ag-sf--appto .ag-sf-bar img{filter:brightness(0) invert(1)}
  .ag-sf--slack .ag-sf-bar{background:#3F0E40}
  .ag-sf--teams .ag-sf-bar{background:#5B5FC7}
  .ag-sf-b{padding:15px 14px;display:grid;gap:13px}
  .ag-sf-u{justify-self:end;max-width:88%;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:13px 13px 4px 13px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45}
  .ag-sf-a,.ag-sf-m{display:grid;grid-template-columns:30px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px;align-items:start}
  .ag-sf-av{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;background-color:var(--c,#E4E4EA)}
  .ag-sf-av .ag-mark{width:58%}
  .ag-sf-av--ph{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .ag-sf-nm{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.012em;color:var(--ink)}
  .ag-sf-nm em{font-style:normal;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#E4E4EA;color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-sf-nm time{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .ag-sf-a p,.ag-sf-m p{margin-top:3px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-2)}
  .ag-sf-src{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:9px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .ag-sf-src img{width:14px;height:14px;object-fit:contain}
  .ag-sf-re{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-top:9px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-sf-re i{font-style:normal;color:var(--ok)}

  /* granice agenta: model / narzędzia / zasięg */
  .ag-lim{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(14px,1.6vw,24px)}
  .ag-lim-c{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:14px;padding:clamp(20px,2vw,28px);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}
  .ag-lim-b{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:14px}
  .ag-lim-k{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .ag-lim-ms{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
  .ag-lim-m{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;opacity:.34;transition:opacity .35s ease,border-color .35s ease,box-shadow .35s ease,transform .35s var(--ease-out)}
  .ag-lim-m.is-on{opacity:1;border-color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(10,10,11,.06);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .ag-lim-lg{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px}
  .ag-lim-lg svg{width:23px;height:23px}
  .ag-lim-lg img{width:22px;height:22px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:5px}
  .ag-lim-ts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px}
  .ag-lim-t{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;opacity:.26;filter:grayscale(1)}
  .ag-lim-t.is-on{opacity:1;filter:none;border-color:var(--line-2)}
  .ag-lim-t img{width:19px;height:19px;object-fit:contain}
  .ag-lim-ds{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;max-width:260px}
  .ag-lim-ds i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(10,10,11,.11)}
  .ag-lim-ds i.is-on{background:var(--ink)}
  .ag-lim-v{margin-top:2px;display:grid;gap:3px}
  .ag-lim-v b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(16px,1.5vw,19px);letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink)}
  .ag-lim-v b.is-fresh{animation:agIn .4s var(--ease-out)}
  @keyframes agIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(5px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .ag-lim-v span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
  .ag-lim-n{padding-top:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted-2)}

  /* dane — jedna karta, sześć stref dzielących hairline (jak .ag-flow) */
  .ap-dane{margin-top:clamp(14px,1.6vw,24px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}
  .ap-dane-i{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px minmax(0,1fr);gap:5px 13px;align-content:start;padding:clamp(18px,1.9vw,26px);border-left:1px solid var(--line);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .ap-dane-i:nth-child(3n+1){border-left:0}
  .ap-dane-i:nth-child(-n+3){border-top:0}
  .ap-dane-i svg{grid-row:span 2;width:19px;height:19px;color:var(--ink);margin-top:1px}
  .ap-dane-i b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.024em;color:var(--ink)}
  .ap-dane-i span{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted)}

  /* ============================== WDROŻENIE: przełącznik na zdjęciu (roles.css + method.css) */
  .ap-roll{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#14131B;padding-block:clamp(88px,12vw,168px);scroll-margin-top:16px}
  .wdr-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:#14131B url("/appto/size-bg.jpg") center / cover no-repeat}
  .wdr-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,12,20,.82) 0%,rgba(13,12,20,.52) 30%,rgba(13,12,20,.36) 56%,rgba(13,12,20,.60) 100%),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(13,12,20,.08) 0%,rgba(13,12,20,0) 45%,rgba(13,12,20,.42) 100%)}
  .ap-roll > .ap-wrap{z-index:2}
  .dk-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:clamp(40px,5vw,84px);align-items:start}
  .dk-h{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.2;font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,23px);color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);margin:0 0 clamp(24px,2.8vw,34px);max-width:22ch}
  .sw-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:clamp(5px,.8vw,12px)}
  .sw-item{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.08;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,44px);color:rgba(255,255,255,.26);transition:color .2s ease}
  .sw-item:hover{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
  .sw-item.is-active{color:#fff}
  .sw-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:6px}
